.Dd November 15, 2026
.Dt DTRACE_STATS 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm dtrace_stats
.Nd report per-CPU DTrace ring statistics
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn dtrace_stats out max
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm writes up to
.Fa max
per-CPU entries to
.Fa out
and returns the number of online CPUs represented by the rings, capped at the
number of ring slots.
An entry is 32 bytes: produced, consumed, dropped and capacity, each a 64-bit
unsigned integer.
A
.Fa max
of zero returns the CPU count without touching
.Fa out .
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EFAULT
.Fa out
is not writable user memory.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
